        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001772921-25-000085-bb86b0cfa19d9ff4",
        "accession_number": "0001772921-25-000085",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, for products we manufacture, we maintain product liability insurance.",
        "start_character": 51166,
        "end_character": 51248
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001772921-25-000085",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001772921-25-000085-bb86b0cfa19d9ff4",
        "accession_number": "0001772921-25-000085",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-15",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our Dealership segment, we offer new and pre-owned recreational boats and other related marine products and boat services through 95 dealerships in 17 states as of September 30, 2025.",
        "start_character": 28183,
        "end_character": 28369
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001772921-25-000085",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001772921-25-000085-bb86b0cfa19d9ff4",
        "accession_number": "0001772921-25-000085",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our sale and servicing of boats and other watercraft as well as the sale of parts and accessories which we manufacture may expose us to potential liabilities for personal injury or property damage claims relating to the use of such products.",
        "start_character": 50658,
        "end_character": 50899
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001772921-25-000085",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001772921-25-000085-bb86b0cfa19d9ff4",
        "accession_number": "0001772921-25-000085",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Provided that we are in compliance with the material obligations of such dealer agreements, they designate an exclusive geographical territory for our dealership to sell a particular boat brand and typically do not restrict our right to sell any other product lines or competing products.",
        "start_character": 35673,
        "end_character": 35961
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001772921-25-000085",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001772921-25-000085-bb86b0cfa19d9ff4",
        "accession_number": "0001772921-25-000085",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-15",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide boat repair and maintenance services, arrange boat financing and insurance and offer other ancillary services, including indoor and outdoor storage, marina services, and rentals of boats and personal watercraft.",
        "start_character": 16083,
        "end_character": 16310
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001772921-25-000085",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001772921-25-000085-bb86b0cfa19d9ff4",
        "accession_number": "0001772921-25-000085",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-15",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide the related repair services, when needed by our customers, pursuant to the service contract guidelines during the contract term at no additional charge to the customer above a deductible.",
        "start_character": 22081,
        "end_character": 22284
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001772921-25-000085",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001772921-25-000085-bb86b0cfa19d9ff4",
        "accession_number": "0001772921-25-000085",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also sell to national and regional distributors that resell our products to specialized retail outlets.",
